  "name": "value-utilities/flex-grid",
  "description": "Flex and grid layout utilities. Static utilities for direction/wrap/align/justify/place/self/grid-flow plus value plugins for basis/flex/grow/shrink/order/gap/grid-cols/grid-rows/col*/row*/auto-cols/auto-rows. Mirrors the corresponding sections of `corePlugins.js` (flexDirection, flexWrap, alignItems, justifyContent, placeItems, alignContent, alignSelf, justifySelf, gridAutoFlow + the value plugins). `col-start`/`col-end`/`row-start`/`row-end`/`order` support negation (`-order-1`, `-col-start-1`).",
